description: 'Integer division/mod by zero produces uninitialized stack garbage instead
  of trapping. `checked_divmod` exists in `src/codegen/arith.rs:249-281` but is only
  called by the dead HIR-direct path. Fix: lift `checked_divmod` to a shared helper
  and call it from `src/codegen/mir_codegen/helpers/values.rs` for all int div/mod/rem
  ops. Also handle INT_MIN / -1 signed overflow. Reproducer: `a is 10; b is 0; log(a
  / b)` must trap, not print garbage. Add a conformance test. (review/14_findings.md
  P0-1, review/15_roadmap.md A.3a)'
